# The terminal that apps marked Terminal=true (nvim, btop, micro) open in from
# Thunar's "Open With" or any other GTK launcher - read by xdg-terminal-exec.
# foot.desktop by name: foot ships two more terminal entries, footclient.desktop
# (needs a running foot server, which nothing here starts) and
# foot-server.desktop (starts one and opens no window).
foot.desktop
